    "q": "A patient with heart failure develops hyponatremia. What mechanism does Mehlman identify on FM forms?",
    "a": "Baroreceptor-mediated ADH release. A reduced systolic impulse is interpreted as volume depletion, promoting free-water retention.",
    "source": {
      "title": "Mehlman HY Family Medicine",
      "page": 4,
      "url": "/mehlman/hy-family-medicine.pdf#page=4"
    }
